 16\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-lg font-semibold\">DevKit</span></a><div class=\"flex items-center gap-6 text-sm text-zinc-400\"><a class=\"transition hover:text-white\" href=\"/\">Home</a><a class=\"transition hover:text-white\" href=\"/tools\">Tools</a><a class=\"transition hover:text-white\" href=\"/about\">About</a><div class=\"h-9 w-20 animate-pulse rounded-lg bg-zinc-900\"></div></div></div></nav><section class=\"mx-auto max-w-4xl px-6 py-20\"><div class=\"max-w-3xl\"><p class=\"mb-3 text-sm text-zinc-500\">About DevKit</p><h1 class=\"text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-5xl\">Developer tools,<br/><span class=\"text-zinc-500\">without the clutter.</span></h1><p class=\"mt-6 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-8 text-zinc-400\">DevKit is an open-source collection of simple, fast and useful tools built for developers.</p><p class=\"mt-4 max-w-2xl leading-7 text-zinc-500\">The goal is simple: provide the tools developers use every day in one clean and accessible place.</p></div><div class=\"mt-14 grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-3\"><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-900/30 p-5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-zap text-zinc-300\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15.914 4a1.5 1.5 0 00-2.474-1.561l-9 9A1.5 1.5 0 005.5 14h4.002a.5.5 0 01.471.666L8.086 20a1.5 1.5 0 002.475 1.56l9-9A1.5 1.5 0 0018.5 10h-3.997a.5.5 0 01-.472-.667z\"></path></svg><h2 class=\"mt-4 font-semibold\">Fast</h2><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-zinc-500\">Lightweight tools designed to work instantly.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-900/30 p-5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-check text-zinc-300\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><h2 class=\"mt-4 font-semibold\">Private</h2><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-zinc-500\">Most tools process your data directly in the browser.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-900/30 p-5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-code-xml text-zinc-300\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m18 16 4-4-4-4\"></path><path d=\"m6 8-4 4 4 4\"></path><path d=\"m14.5 4-5 16\"></path></svg><h2 class=\"mt-4 font-semibold\">Open Source</h2><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-zinc-500\">The project is public and open for developers to explore and improve.</p></div></div><div class=\"mt-6 rounded-xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-900/40 p-6\"><h2 class=\"text-lg font-semibold\">Built with</h2><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-zinc-500\">DevKit is built with modern web technologies.</p><div class=\"mt-5 flex flex-wrap gap-2\"><span class=\"rounded-md border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-900 px-3 py-1.5 text-sm text-zinc-400\">Next.js</span><span class=\"rounded-md border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-900 px-3 py-1.5 text-sm text-zinc-400\">TypeScript</span><span class=\"rounded-md border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-900 px-3 py-1.5 text-sm text-zinc-400\">React</span><span class=\"rounded-md border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-900 px-3 py-1.5 text-sm text-zinc-400\">Tailwind CSS</span><span class=\"rounded-md border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-900 px-3 py-1.5 text-sm text-zinc-400\">Lucide React</span></div></div><div class=\"mt-6 rounded-xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-900/40 p-6\"><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-5\"><div><h2 class=\"text-lg font-semibold\">Open Source</h2><p class=\"mt-2 max-w-xl text-sm leading-6 text-zinc-500\">Want to explore the code, report an issue or contribute a new tool? The project is available on GitHub.</p></div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-code-xml shrink-0 text-zinc-500\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m18 16 4-4-4-4\"></path><path d=\"m6 8-4 4 4 4\"></path><path d=\"m14.5 4-5 16\"></path></svg></div><a href=\"https://github.com/parsarvs1/devkit\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"mt-5 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-lg border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-900 px-4 py-2.5 text-sm text-zinc-300 transition hover:border-zinc-700 hover:text-white\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-code-xml\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m18 16 4-4-4-4\"></path><path d=\"m6 8-4 4 4 4\"></path><path d=\"m14.5 4-5 16\"></path></svg>View on GitHub</a></div><div class=\"mt-10 rounded-2xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-900/30 p-8 text-center\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold\">Ready to use DevKit?</h2><p class=\"mx-auto mt-3 max-w-lg text-sm leading-6 text-zinc-500\">Explore the available tools and find what you need for your next project.</p><a class=\"mt-6 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-lg bg-white px-5 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-black transition hover:bg-zinc-200\" href=\"/tools\">Explore Tools<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 